---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Legal from '../components/Legal.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | JP Silva Digital"
      description="What JP Silva Digital collects when you use this site, why, and how to have it removed.">
  <Legal heading="Privacy Policy" updated="July 2026">
    <h2 class="h3">What this site collects</h2>
    <p class="body">Only what you type into the planner or send by email: your name, business
    name, email address, optional phone number, optional website address, and whatever you
    write in the notes field.</p>
    <p class="body">Your answers inside the planner are held in your browser's session storage
    so you can move backwards without losing them. They are cleared when you close the tab,
    and nothing is sent anywhere until you submit.</p>

    <h2 class="h3">What it does not do</h2>
    <p class="body">No advertising trackers, no third-party analytics scripts, no cookies set
    for marketing, and no fingerprinting. Nothing you provide is sold, rented, or added to a
    mailing list.</p>

    <h2 class="h3">Why it is collected</h2>
    <p class="body">To reply to you and to scope a project. That is the whole purpose.</p>

    <h2 class="h3">How long it is kept</h2>
    <p class="body">Inquiry records are kept for as long as we might reasonably still be in
    conversation, and no longer than twenty-four months.</p>

    <h2 class="h3">Removing your information</h2>
    <p class="body">Email <a class="tlink" href="mailto:jp@jpsilvadigital.com">jp@jpsilvadigital.com</a>
    and ask. It will be deleted, and you will get confirmation that it has been.</p>
  </Legal>
</Base>
